"tlh":{"tag":"Lucy van Pelt rur: “Psychiatric Help 5¢ - The Doctor Is In”","s1":"Ace DatlhejmeH wa' Qu' qep nIteb","s2":"ghu' yajchu'meH chov, mIwmey veb ta'laHlu'bogh je poQbogh ghotpu'vaD, taHbogh QummeH mab lajbe'taHvIS.","s3":"DaH DaghomeH qay'wI'vaD lI'laH qep; DoS le' DaSIchmeH mIw nIvvaD lI'laH; pagh pIq He DaSovbe'DI', He DawIvmeH lI'laH.","glance":"De' potlh","dfee":"qav'ap","vfee":"$500 CAD","dfmt":"mIw","vfmt":"wa' qep pegh — nItebHa' DaqDaq, 'Internet lo'taHvIS, pagh QumwI' lo'taHvIS","best":"ghotpu'vamvaD lI'qu'","vbest":"DaH wa' ghu'vaD qeS nap, qeS ta'laHlu'bogh je luneHbogh ghotpu'vaD; wa' qepDaq SuQapchuqlaH 'e' chov luneHbogh ghotpu'vaD je.","appr":"vummeH mIw","t1":"ghu' ghojmeH ghel","wp1":"qay'wI'lIj, De' potlh je DaDel. 'Ij Ace 'ej 'utbogh ghelmeH mu'tlheghmey jatlh. ngoDmey buSlaH Qum, pagh leS 'ej ghu' pablaH.","t2":"chov","p2":"mIw veb qeS nobpa' Ace, bojatlhpu'bogh mu'mey qel. mIw chu' chupmoHlaH, mIwlIj loQ choH 'e' chupmoHlaH, pagh mIwlIj yIpabtaH jatlhlaH.","t3":"Delqa'meH mu'mey run","wp3":"Ace DatlhejtaHvIS ghu' boqelqa'. DuHmey Delqa'chu' ghaH, tIqbe'bogh mu'mey lo'taHvIS; vaj mIw veb Data'laHbogh Dayajchu'.","t4":"mIwmey veb","wp4":"latlh <a href='private-working-session.html'>wa' Qu' qep pegh</a> yInab, pagh Ace <a href='advisory.html'>taHbogh qeS pegh</a> yIlo'. qeS, mIwmey je tIqaw, 'ej DapabmeH Hoch laHlIj yIlo'.","sm1":"90–120 tup qepvaD $500 'oH wa' Qu' qep pegh qav'ap'e'. qep poH nab Ace boQwI'. nabmeH wa' malja' jaj, pagh cha' malja' jaj, yIpIH.","sm2":"DaH ghu' Daleghbogh mIw DaDelmeH yIrup; bIjangDI' yIyuDHa'. De' nav 'IH vI'elta' poQbe'lu'. De' ngo' ghajlu'chugh lI', 'ach 'utbe'.","sm3":"wa' qay'wI' neH buS qepvam. latlh qay'wI'mey, Ace DatlhejtaHmeH mab ghap qelmeH nIteb Qumlu'.","go":"yItagh","note":"yapbe'chugh wa' qep, pagh qepmey jojDaq pay' Ace DaQumlaH 'e' DaneHchugh, <a href='advisory.html'>taHbogh qeS pegh</a> yIHaD."},
